<div class="dt-builder">
  <h2>Build/Rebuild Stock RollTables</h2>
  <p>Always stock is guaranteed. Rotating stock adds Often and Rarely goods using real compendium items.</p>
  <p>Build the Item compendium first. This builder creates a separate Stock RollTables compendium.</p>
  {{#if catalogueError}}
    <pre class="dt-warning" role="alert">{{catalogueError}}</pre>
  {{else}}
    <fieldset class="dt-builder-selection" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}><legend>Build scope</legend>
      <label>Catalogue<select data-builder-select="shop"><option value="" {{#if allShops}}selected{{/if}}>All catalogues</option>{{#each shops}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
      {{#if hasVariants}}<label>Stock profile<select data-builder-select="profile"><option value="" {{#if allProfiles}}selected{{/if}}>All profiles</option>{{#each profileChoices}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
      <label>Category (stock rolls / legacy cleanup only)<select data-builder-select="category"><option value="" {{#if allCategories}}selected{{/if}}>All categories</option>{{#each categories}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}} · {{count}} products</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    </fieldset>
    {{> "modules/devils-table/templates/generation-summary.hbs"}}
    <p><strong>{{scopeLabel}}</strong> — {{tableCount}} tables in {{setCount}} sets.</p>
    <p>Each set: Always Stock, Often Stock, Rarely Stock and Rotating Stock.</p>
    <p>Builds create four tables per stock profile. Category rolls filter those shared tables; no category tables are needed. Select one profile to roll stock.</p>
    <p>Rotating draws: Often {{oftenChance}}% · Rarely {{rarelyChance}}% · No extra stock {{noneChance}}%. Empty or exhausted tiers add no item.</p>
    <details><summary>Stock profiles and merchant guidance ({{setCount}})</summary>
    {{#each profiles}}
      <p>{{name}}: up to {{draws}} rotating draws. {{#if partial}}<strong>Partial catalogue: authored shared goods only.</strong>{{/if}}</p>
      <p>{{description}}</p>
      <details class="dt-merchant-notes">
        <summary>Merchant Notes — {{name}}</summary>
        <p>Builder guidance only; these notes are not exported into table or Item documents.</p>
        <div class="dt-stock-tiers">
          <section><h3>Always Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each merchantNotes.alwaysStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
          <section><h3>Often Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each merchantNotes.oftenStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
          <section><h3>Rarely Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each merchantNotes.rarelyStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
        </div>
      </details>
    {{/each}}
    </details>
  {{/if}}
  <fieldset {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>
    <legend>GM actions</legend>
    <button type="button" data-action="preview" {{#if blocked}}disabled{{/if}}>Validate / Preview Tables</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="build" {{#if blocked}}disabled{{/if}}>Build / Rebuild Tables</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="rollStock" {{#if rollBlocked}}disabled{{/if}}>Roll Stock &amp; Quantities</button>

  </fieldset>
  <p>Stock rolls include Always goods and distinct rotating choices, then roll a quantity for each. Cheaper, more common goods tend to have larger stocks; Rare goods usually have one sale unit. Inventories stay under GM control.</p>
  <details><summary>Maintenance — legacy category tables</summary><p>Preview before removing superseded tables. Edited tables and known links are protected.</p><button type="button" data-action="cleanup" {{#if blocked}}disabled{{/if}}>Preview Legacy Cleanup</button></details>
  <h3>Report</h3>
  <pre class="dt-report" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">{{report}}</pre>
  <details><summary>Last table build record</summary><pre>{{lastBuild}}</pre></details>
  <details><summary>Last legacy cleanup record</summary><pre>{{lastCleanup}}</pre></details>
</div>
